Prepared LongBench v2 request excerpts

Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/zai-org/LongBench-v2
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.15204
Authors: Yushi Bai, Shangqing Tu, Jiajie Zhang, Hao Peng, Xiaozhi Wang,
Xin Lv, Shulin Cao, Jiazheng Xu, Lei Hou, Yuxiao Dong, Jie Tang, Juanzi Li.
The dataset declares Apache License 2.0; see LONGBENCH_LICENSE.

This port modifies the source prompts by applying InferenceBench's original
seeded selection and head truncation, retaining only the first ten requests
per scenario and seed. requests.json.gz records the source pool, tokenizer,
scenario configuration, and prepared request SHA-256 hashes.
The original dataset and model were not revision-pinned by InferenceBench;
these hashes identify the inputs used to prepare this packaged snapshot.
